OL,3,GNEWSAResidents forced to dodge 100 bins
OL,4,Aleft on street
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharles Quinn, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for environment, said
OL,8,Fbins left out after collection day were
OL,9,Fbeing tagged, and blue or brown bins
OL,10,Fwould be removed if the problem
OL,11,Fcontinued.
